    <comment>Overall experimental uncertainties were not reported in the paper. It was reported that the maximum LBV uncertainty due to temperature uncertainty is 5%. The radiation-induced LBV uncertainty changed between 4% and 16%. According to the authors, LBV uncertainty coming from other factors is negligible rlative to these two contributions. As a conservative estimation, the overall experimental LBV uncertainty was calculated as follows: d_LBV = sqrt(0.05^2+0.16^2) = 0.167631 (16.7631%). This is considered as the 2sigma experimental uncertainty.</comment>
    <comment>Air was assumed to be composed of 21% O2 and 79% N2.</comment>
